#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:2
msgid "OneLogin"
msgstr "OneLogin"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:4
msgid ""
"By integrating OneLogin with |morpheus|, users can access |morpheus| with "
"their existing credentials set up within the OneLogin platform. "
"Additionally, administrators can manage user access including Role "
"assignment and enabling or disabling users from within the OneLogin "
"platform. As employees are onboarded, change positions, or leave the "
"company, additional user management within the |morpheus| platform is not "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"By integrating OneLogin con |morpheus|, users puede acceso |morpheus| con "
"their existente credentials set up dentro de el OneLogin platform. "
"Adicionalmente, administrators puede manage user acceso including Role "
"assignment y enabling o disabling users desde dentro de el OneLogin "
"platform. As employees son onboarded, cambio positions, o leave el company, "
"adicional user management dentro de el |morpheus| platform no es necesario."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:7
msgid "Adding OneLogin Identity Source Integration"
msgstr "Agregar OneLogin Identity Source integración"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:9
msgid ""
"To begin, log into OneLogin with an administrator account to gather some "
"needed pieces of information. From the top menu bar, select Administration. "
"From the admin panel, click Developers > API Credentials. Click the button "
"labeled \"New Credential\". Provide a name for the new API credentials and "
"select \"Manage Users\" as the permissions type. Store the credentials "
"somewhere they can be retrieved in the next step."
msgstr ""
"To begin, log en OneLogin con un administrator cuenta to gather algunos "
"needed pieces of información. Desde el top menú bar, select Administration. "
"Desde el admin panel, click Developers > API Credentials. Haga clic en el "
"botón labeled \"New Credential\". Provide un nombre para el nuevo API "
"credentials y select \"Manage Users\" as el permisos tipo. Store el "
"credentials somewhere they puede be retrieved in el siguiente paso."

msgid ""
".. image:: "
"images/integration_guides/identity_sources/oneLogin/oneLoginKey.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"images/integration_guides/identity_sources/oneLogin/oneLoginKey.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:14
msgid ""
"Back in |morpheus|, navigate to the Tenant which will integrate with "
"OneLogin. Identity providers are integrated on a per-Tenant basis in "
"|morpheus|. From the selected Tenant, click :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES`. "
"The list of currently-integrated identity providers is here. Click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD IDENTITY SOURCE` to start a new integration for OneLogin. "
"Fill in the fields below:"
msgstr ""
"Back in |morpheus|, navigate to el Tenant cual será integrate con OneLogin. "
"Identity proveedores son integrated on un per-Tenant basis in |morpheus|. "
"Desde el seleccionado Tenant, click :guilabel:`FUENTES DE IDENTIDAD`. The "
"lista of actualmente-integrated identity proveedores es aquí. Click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD IDENTITY SOURCE` to start un nuevo integration para "
"OneLogin. Complete el campos a continuación:"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:16
msgid "**TYPE:** OneLogin"
msgstr "**TYPE:** OneLogin"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:17
msgid "**NAME:** A name for the identity source integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"**NAME:** A nombre para el fuente de identidad integration in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:18
msgid "**DESCRIPTION:** An optional description for the identity source"
msgstr "**DESCRIPTION:** An opcional descripción para el fuente de identidad"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:19
msgid ""
"**ONELOGIN SUBDOMAIN:** The subdomain from your OneLogin portal URL. For "
"example, \"morpheus-dev\" if your portal is accessed at morpheus-"
"dev.onelogin.com. Incorrect subdomains will cause login attempts to "
"|morpheus| to fail"
msgstr ""
"**ONELOGIN SUBDOMAIN:** The subdomain desde your OneLogin portal URL. Por "
"ejemplo, \"morpheus-dev\" if your portal es accessed at morpheus-"
"dev.onelogin.com. Incorrect subdomains será cause login attempts to "
"|morpheus| to fail"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:20
msgid "**ONELOGIN REGION:** Specify US or EU region"
msgstr "**ONELOGIN REGION:** Specify US o EU region"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:21
msgid ""
"**API CLIENT SECRET:** OneLogin API client secret which was gathered earlier"
" in this walkthrough"
msgstr ""
"**API CLIENT SECRET:** OneLogin API client secret cual fue gathered earlier "
"in este walkthrough"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:22
msgid ""
"**API CLIENT ID:** OneLogin API client ID which was gathered earlier in this"
" walkthrough"
msgstr ""
"**API CLIENT ID:** OneLogin API client ID cual fue gathered earlier in este "
"walkthrough"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:23
msgid ""
"**REQUIRED ROLE:** Enter a role which OneLogin users logging into |morpheus|"
" must have to gain access to |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"**REQUIRED ROLE:** Enter un rol cual OneLogin users logging en |morpheus| "
"debe tienen to gain acceso to |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:24
msgid ""
"**DEFAULT ROLE:** The default |morpheus| Role applied to users created from "
"the OneLogin integration if no other role mapping is specified in other Role"
" Mappings fields"
msgstr ""
"**DEFAULT ROLE:** The predeterminado |morpheus| Role applied to users creado"
" desde el OneLogin integration if no otro role mapping es especificado in "
"otro Role Mappings campos"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:25
msgid ""
"**ROLE MAPPINGS:** All existing |morpheus| Roles will be listed with fields "
"to enter OneLogin Roles to create a mapping. Users with OneLogin roles "
"matching the role mappings will be assigned the appropriate Role(s) in "
"|morpheus| when signing in"
msgstr ""
"**ROLE MAPPINGS:** All existente |morpheus| Roles será be listed con campos "
"to enter OneLogin Roles to create un mapping. Users con OneLogin roles "
"matching el rol mappings será be assigned el apropiado Role(s) in |morpheus|"
" cuando signing in"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:26
msgid ""
"**ENABLE ROLE MAPPING PERMISSION:** When selected, Tenant users with "
"appropriate rights to view and edit Roles will have the ability to set role "
"mapping for the Identity Source integration. This allows the Tenant user to "
"edit only the role mappings without viewing or potentially editing the core "
"integration fields (such as the API keys)"
msgstr ""
"**ENABLE ROLE MAPPING PERMISSION:** When seleccionado, Tenant users con "
"apropiado rights to view y edit Roles será tienen el ability to set role "
"mapping para el Identity Source integration. This allows el Tenant user to "
"edit solo el rol mappings sin viewing o potentially editing el core "
"integration campos (como el API keys)"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:27
msgid ""
"**MANUAL ROLE ASSIGNMENT:** When selected, administrators can manually edit "
"Roles for users created through this identity source integration from the "
"user detail page (|AdmUse| > Selected user)."
msgstr ""
"**MANUAL ROLE ASSIGNMENT:** When seleccionado, administrators puede "
"manualmente edit Roles para users creado a través de este fuente de "
"identidad integration desde el usuario página de detalles (|AdmUse| > "
"Selected user)."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:29
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES` and the OneLogin Integration will be added."
msgstr ""
"Select :guilabel:`GUARDAR CHANGES` y el OneLogin Integration será be "
"agregado."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:31
msgid ""
"Users can now login to |morpheus| with OneLogin credentials. The first login"
" will create a user in |morpheus| matching the username, email and password "
"from OneLogin. If a REQUIRED ROLE is specified in the Identity Source "
"settings, only users with that Role in OneLogin will be able to login to "
"|morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"Users puede ahora login to |morpheus| con OneLogin credentials. The primero "
"login será create un usuario in |morpheus| matching el usuarioname, email y "
"contraseña desde OneLogin. If un REQUIRED ROLE es especificado in el "
"Identity Source configuración, solo users con que Role in OneLogin será be "
"able to login to |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:33
msgid ""
"OneLogin users will not authenticate in |morpheus| if there is an existing "
"|morpheus| User with matching username or email address."
msgstr ""
"OneLogin users no authenticate in |morpheus| if allí es un existente "
"|morpheus| User con matching nombre de usuario o email dirección."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:35
msgid ""
"You can now test the integration by logging in with user credentials which "
"have been configured in OneLogin. On the first login, a new user will be "
"created with the same username, email address, and password as contained in "
"OneLogin. On subsequent logins, |morpheus| will sync with OneLogin to make "
"sure the user hasn't been disabled or if its Role(s) have changed in "
"OneLogin which would affect its corresponding Roles in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"You puede ahora test la integración by logging in con user credentials cual "
"tienen sido configurado in OneLogin. En el primero login, un nuevo user será"
" creado con el mismo nombre de usuario, email dirección, y contraseña as "
"contained in OneLogin. On subsequent logins, |morpheus| será sync con "
"OneLogin to asegúrese de el usuario hasn't sido deshabilitado o if its "
"Role(s) tienen cambiado in OneLogin cual sería affect its corresponding "
"Roles in |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:37
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| identity source integration is interacting with the OneLogin "
"APIs in the list below. This reference may be needed to ensure |morpheus| is"
" integrating using an API key with sufficient privileges. In a situation "
"where troubleshooting is needed, first confirm these APIs can be accessed "
"using the provided key."
msgstr ""
"The |morpheus| fuente de identidad integration es interacting con el "
"OneLogin APIs in el lista a continuación. This referencia puede ser "
"necesario to ensure |morpheus| es integrating using un API key con "
"sufficient privileges. In un situation donde troubleshooting es needed, "
"primero confirm estos APIs se puede acceder using el provided key."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:39
msgid "``/auth/oauth2/token`` - Generate Token"
msgstr "``/auth/oauth2/token`` - Generate Token"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:40
msgid "``/api/1/users/$user_id/roles`` - Get Roles"
msgstr "``/api/1/users/$user_id/roles`` - Get Roles"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:41
msgid "``/api/1/login/auth`` - Create Session"
msgstr "``/api/1/login/auth`` - Create Session"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:42
msgid "``/api/1/users/$user_id`` - Get User"
msgstr "``/api/1/users/$user_id`` - Get User"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:43
msgid "``/api/1/roles/$role_id`` - Get Role"
msgstr "``/api/1/roles/$role_id`` - Get Role"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:44
msgid "``/api/1/roles?name=$role_name`` - Find Role"
msgstr "``/api/1/roles?name=$role_name`` - Find Role"
